3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-31fda7e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"31fda7e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Integration<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b09e5a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4b09e5a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Works with your analysis tools<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1faa653 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1faa653\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>n2disk integrates with <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/products\/traffic-analysis\/ntopng\/\">ntopng<\/a>, so you can jump from an alert to the packets behind it. Capture performance comes from <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/products\/packet-capture\/pf_ring\/\">PF_RING<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-087f46a e-con-boxed e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"087f46a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d036986 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d036986\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Which traffic recording tool do I need?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-757780a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"757780a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>n2disk records full-sized packets to disk at up to 100 Gbit with on-the-fly indexing, in the standard PCAP format, so you can retrieve the exact traffic for an incident. disk2n replays recorded traffic at line rate for testing and analysis. Start with n2disk when you need packet-level proof for troubleshooting, forensics or compliance.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c0c354a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c0c354a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d84686c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d84686c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-99cba86 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"99cba86\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bc05e40 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bc05e40\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Get started<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c4048f5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c4048f5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Not sure which one to choose?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-70c1279 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"70c1279\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.